# --- large inputs -----------------------------------------------------
# 74 MB of Stanford scans, WikiText-2 and a Redis checkout. Fetched by the
# benchmark scripts; a clone should not carry them.
corpora/

# NOTE: test-logs/ is deliberately NOT ignored. TEST_REPORT.md quotes those
# runs, and for a project whose claim is "measure, don't claim" the raw
# output is the evidence -- 264 KB is a cheap price for a reader being able
# to check a number against the log that produced it.

